\section{Results}
Experiments confirm:
\begin{itemize}
    \item Bott index preservation until $\rho_d^* \approx 0.74$
    \item Autonomous solver interception at $\kappa > 10^{10}$
    \item Stable distributed memory behavior for $N > 10^7$
